    <string name="credential_backup_off_title">Turn the sealed backup off?</string>
    <string name="credential_backup_off_body">If this phone is lost, broken, reset or replaced without a transfer, your vault &lt;b&gt;cannot be recovered&lt;/b&gt;. It can only be deleted and replaced by a new one, and &lt;b&gt;everything in it is lost&lt;/b&gt;.</string>
